Not a dumb question. The [device] won't sound dramatically different, but I suggest people get one because it's so good and well suited for many different kinds of headphones that if you buy one you will likely never want to or need to replace it. I use mine with a pair of [expensive headphones] and I don't have a problem with it being the weakest link in my chain.

